%% Carried forward unchanged from v1.2 — no correction in the v1.3 change list applied to this diagram.

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CRM_Draft: CRM starts allocation

    CRM_Draft --> CRM_Draft: Missing CCF upload or KYC checkbox\n(blocked server-side, §21)
    CRM_Draft --> CSO_Pending: CRM submits\n(CCF + KYC present)

    CSO_Pending --> Mgmt_Allocation_Pending: CSO Approves
    CSO_Pending --> CRM_Draft: CSO Sends Back\n(remark mandatory)

    Mgmt_Allocation_Pending --> Allocation_Approved: Management Approves\n(financials locked here, §19)
    Mgmt_Allocation_Pending --> CRM_Draft: Management Sends Back\n(remark mandatory)

    Allocation_Approved --> [*]: Unit status → ALLOCATION_APPROVED\nATS + Sale Deed workflows unlocked

    note right of Allocation_Approved
        This is Management Approval #1 of 3
        (independent of ATS / Sale Deed approvals, §22)
    end note
